==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|cu|ru}} {{m|cu|людиє}}, from {{etyl|sla-pro|ru}} {{m|sla-pro|*ljudъ}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ru}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₁lewdʰ-o-||men, people}}. Compare {{etyl|en|-}} ''[[lede#Etymology 2|lede]]'', {{etyl|non|-}} {{m|non|lýðr|lýðir|people}} ({{etyl|is|-}} {{m|is|lýður}}), {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐌻𐌹𐌿𐌸𐍃}}, {{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|Leute}}, {{etyl|grc|-}} {{m|grc|ἐλεύθερος}}, {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|līber}}, {{m|la|līberī}}.

